cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the version-specific DOI once the v2.0.0 release is archived.
  The historical DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22012996 identifies v1.0.0, not
  the new IJPHM 2026 experiments.
title: "RPDindex Aircraft-Engine Analysis: IJPHM 2026 Near-Endpoint Experiments"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Righi"
    given-names: "Marco"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1448-0960"
    email: "marco.righi@cnr.it"
    affiliation: "Institute of Clinical Physiology, National Research Council of Italy (CNR-IFC), Massa, Italy; Department of Computer Science, University of Pisa, Pisa, Italy"
version: "2.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/marcorighi/RPDindexAircraftEngineRUL"
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python pipeline and audits for retrospective near-endpoint
  discrimination on the NASA C-MAPSS FD001--FD004 training trajectories
  using prefix RPDgep features, nested alarm thresholds and nine-model
  component ablation. No prospective failure-prediction validation is claimed.
keywords:
  - RPDindex
  - C-MAPSS
  - prognostics
  - near-endpoint discrimination
  - reproducibility
